Create.Define. Brand.)!</span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin:0px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;font-size:18.4px;line-height:normal;min-height:23.8px;color:rgb(0,0,0);letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration-thickness:auto;text-decoration-style:solid;\"><br></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin:0px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;font-size:18.4px;line-height:normal;color:rgb(0,0,0);letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration-thickness:auto;text-decoration-style:solid;\"><span class=\"s3\" style=\"font-family:UICTFontTextStyleBody;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-size:18.4px;\">Our purpose is to inspire a better way of living with emphasis on the power of words with conscious designs that will last through time.</span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin:0px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;font-size:18.4px;line-height:normal;color:rgb(0,0,0);letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration-thickness:auto;text-decoration-style:solid;\"><span class=\"s3\" style=\"font-family:UICTFontTextStyleBody;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-size:18.4px;\">Affiliates can earn 10% on commissions with additional incentives, such as bonuses for referrals, MLM (earn 5% on each affiliate referral gained on their sales) and more!</span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin:0px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;font-size:18.4px;line-height:normal;min-height:23.8px;color:rgb(0,0,0);letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration-thickness:auto;text-decoration-style:solid;\"><br></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin:0px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;font-size:18.4px;line-height:normal;color:rgb(0,0,0);letter-spaci